{"4528170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sting & Swing", "steam_appid": 4528170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken The Bee from its slumber to play the ultimate game of exploratory golf through this mysterious verdant labyrinth. The peaceful pixel scenery soothes as easily as it conceals surprises around each corner. This is a world you can get lost in but also come to call home with some practice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dense overgrown world brimming with secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear design lets you go wherever your curiosity leads you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room has new vistas to find in this living world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4528170/extras/cab4d66623ed87f50f8f4183de9d7475.poster.avif?t=1781051558\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4528170/extras/cab4d66623ed87f50f8f4183de9d7475.webm?t=1781051558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4528170/extras/cab4d66623ed87f50f8f4183de9d7475.mp4?t=1781051558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY GOLF</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the tactile physics of bee-golfing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all the flags in this massive interconnected golf-course of a world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise the many varied environments to your advantage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr